#: includes/class-settings.php:223
msgid "Domain search"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາໂດເມນ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:224
msgid "Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode"
msgstr "ລະບຸ shortcode [zinn_domain_search]"

#: includes/class-settings.php:225
msgid "Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you."
msgstr "ວາງ shortcode ໃສ່ໜ້າໃດກໍໄດ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມກວດສອບໂດເມນ ແລະ ຊື້ມັນຜ່ານທ່ານ."

#: includes/class-settings.php:231
msgid "Panel link"
msgstr "ລິ້ງແຜງຄວບຄຸມ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:232
msgid "Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers"
msgstr "ສະແດງລິ້ງ \"ໂຮສຕິ້ງຂອງຂ້ອຍ\" ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:238
msgid "WooCommerce provisioning"
msgstr "ການຈັດສັນ WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-settings.php:239
msgid "Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes"
msgstr "ຈັດສັນໂຮສຕິ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ WooCommerce ສຳເລັດ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:240
msgid "Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan."
msgstr "ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ມີຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ທ່ານໄດ້ຈັບຄູ່ກັບແພັກເກດ Zinn® ໄວ້ແລ້ວເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: includes/class-settings.php:256
msgid "Domain search appearance"
msgstr "ຮູບລັກສະນະການຊອກຫາໂດເມນ"

#: includes/class-settings.php:257
msgid "This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours."
msgstr "ວິດເຈັດນີ້ສະແດງຜົນພາຍໃນຮູບແບບສີສັນຂອງທ່ານເອງ. ເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ, ຫຼື ກຳນົດສີຂອງທ່ານເອງ — ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເລືອກແບບໃດ ກໍບໍ່ມີສິ່ງໃດຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ໜ້າເວັບຂອງທ່ານທີ່ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມຈະເຫັນວ່າເປັນຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#: includes/class-settings.php:265
msgid "Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover."
msgstr "ທຸກໆ class ທີ່ widget ໃຊ້ແມ່ນໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນ readme ຂອງປລັກອິນ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນນັກພັດທະນາຈຶ່ງສາມາດຂຽນທັບສິ່ງໃດກໍຕາມທີ່ຄ່າຕັ້ງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ກວມເອົາ."

